  "description": "Despite his terrible luck in life, Ted was a top livestreaming musketeer in the fully immersive VR game, \"Face Chronicle.\" But his bad luck made him stumble upon a conspiracy where major guilds were illegally taming boss monsters to get ahead. They were far from happy when Ted threatened to expose them, so they coerced him into deleting his game character, which forced him to start over. Can Ted turn his luck around by starting all over from level one? Or will his bad luck ruin his last shot?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
